### MCDT Client, Diagnostics, Options & Registries
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:25580
@token = test-token

### 1. Client engine & window diagnostics
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/client
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 2. Live game options
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/options
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 3. Patch options (e.g. FOV and render distance)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/options
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fov": 85,
  "renderDistance": 12
}

### 4. Framebuffer screenshot capture (scale 0.5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/screenshot?scale=0.5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 5. Enumerate built-in registries
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/registries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 6. Query entries in minecraft:item registry
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/registries/minecraft:item?limit=10&query=diamond
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 7. Query entries in minecraft:block registry
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/registries/minecraft:block?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 8. Camera perspective and FOV
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/camera
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 9. Update camera perspective
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/camera
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "perspective": "third_person_back",
  "fov": 85.0
}

### 10. Window state
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/window
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 11. Debug overlay and renderers (F3, hitboxes, chunk borders)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/debug
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 12. Toggle hitboxes and chunk borders
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/debug
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hitboxes": true,
  "chunkBorders": true
}

### 13. Key mappings list
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/keybinds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 14. Rebind key mapping
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/keybinds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rebinds": {
    "key.forward": "key.keyboard.up"
  }
}

### 15. Resource packs
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/resourcepacks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
